  "content": {
    "id": "p32-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "Ahmed collected data on the age ($a$) and height ($h$) of males aged 11 to 16 years.\n\nHe created a scatterplot of the data and constructed a line of best fit to model the relationship between the age and height of males.",
