              "sourceRegion": "Question 9, left-hand graph",
              "description": "Age and height scatterplot with black circular markers, major grid, 2 cm horizontal subdivisions and the supplied line of best fit.",
              "mathematics": "Age axis 10–17 years; height plotting range 130–200 cm. The line passes through (11,146) and (16,176), giving h=6a+80. Unlabelled data-point positions are reconstructed from the source image, not supplied as a numerical dataset.",
